Error [E2405]: Duplicate error conversion: `impl ParseErr -> AppErr` is already declared
  --> tests/ui/e2405_dup_error_conv.jet:12:6
    |
 12 | impl ParseErr -> AppErr { return AppErr.Parse(self) }
    |      ^^^^^^^^
 Why: There can be at most one declared way to convert a `Source` error into a `Target`
 Fix: Remove one of the two `impl … -> …` blocks
